{
    "title": "Vlad and Niki \u2013 games & videos",
    "description": "Vlad & Niki is the free official app with funny boys on the popular YouTube channel Vlad and Niki. Watch educational video and complete easy games puzzles!\r\n\r\nThe Vlad & Niki app is safe for the brains of kids older than toddlers and an indispensable assistant for busy parents. The free app is perfect for boys and girls of preschool age.\r\n\r\nBENEFITS:\r\n\u2014 The largest video collection of episodes that is suitable for kids 0 to 5 years old. There are funny videos about ice cream, supermarket, superheroes, shopping, cooking and driving by car, etc. Use your phone as a portable TV and run video clips for fun learning. \r\n\u2014 The two boys in the videos speak easy English understandable for children of any age. At the same time, small video movies TV have a lot of colorful animations and funny sounds that will please kids that are not toddlers anymore and cheer them up.\r\n\u2014 There are a lot of easy puzzle games with Vlad and Niki, in which every child will feel like a part of a children's team and develop by playing. The app has games for kids about drawing, supermarket, cooking, shopping, shapes and colors, etc.\r\n\u2014 Educational app with games and small video movies TV are suitable for kids older than toddlers and children 2, 3, 4 and 5 years old. Babies will be delighted!\r\n\r\nABOUT VLAD AND NIKI\r\nVlad & Niki are two boys who have gained popularity on YouTube thanks to short-duration videos in which they have fun talking in easy English and simultaneously learning something new.\r\n\r\nNow you can not only watch the boys on the YouTube channel, but also become part of their friendly and smart team in the game. Watch, play and learn!\r\n\r\nApply for a Fun Pass in order to:\r\n\u2014 Open up and run all episodes of the best show for children about Vlad and Niki. And get bonus video clips that are not available on the channel.\r\n\u2014 Download episodes of this fun and informative show to watch offline (no internet and no wifi).\r\n\u2014 Receive weekly updates / additions to apps. New games every week!\r\n\u2014 Remove all ads from the app.\r\n\r\nKids watch, learn, play and have fun!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Vlad &amp; Niki is the free official app with funny boys on the popular YouTube channel Vlad and Niki. Watch educational video and complete easy games puzzles!<br><br>The Vlad &amp; Niki app is safe for the brains of kids older than toddlers and an indispensable assistant for busy parents. The free app is perfect for boys and girls of preschool age.<br><br>BENEFITS:<br>\u2014 The largest video collection of episodes that is suitable for kids 0 to 5 years old. There are funny videos about ice cream, supermarket, superheroes, shopping, cooking and driving by car, etc. Use your phone as a portable TV and run video clips for fun learning. <br>\u2014 The two boys in the videos speak easy English understandable for children of any age. At the same time, small video movies TV have a lot of colorful animations and funny sounds that will please kids that are not toddlers anymore and cheer them up.<br>\u2014 There are a lot of easy puzzle games with Vlad and Niki, in which every child will feel like a part of a children&#39;s team and develop by playing. The app has games for kids about drawing, supermarket, cooking, shopping, shapes and colors, etc.<br>\u2014 Educational app with games and small video movies TV are suitable for kids older than toddlers and children 2, 3, 4 and 5 years old. Babies will be delighted!<br><br>ABOUT VLAD AND NIKI<br>Vlad &amp; Niki are two boys who have gained popularity on YouTube thanks to short-duration videos in which they have fun talking in easy English and simultaneously learning something new.<br><br>Now you can not only watch the boys on the YouTube channel, but also become part of their friendly and smart team in the game. Watch, play and learn!<br><br>Apply for a Fun Pass in order to:<br>\u2014 Open up and run all episodes of the best show for children about Vlad and Niki. And get bonus video clips that are not available on the channel.<br>\u2014 Download episodes of this fun and informative show to watch offline (no internet and no wifi).<br>\u2014 Receive weekly updates / additions to apps. New games every week!<br>\u2014 Remove all ads from the app.<br><br>Kids watch, learn, play and have fun!",
